	skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso22989> ;
	skos:note "Where a characteristic of NIST's AI Risk Management Framework, as lmodel/nist-ai-100-1 renders it, holds a property, the value maps to it: broad where NIST joins the property with another, close for fairness." ;
